WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.167
Okay!

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:10.900
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.467
A.

00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:12.000
Trumpet,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.567
B.

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:13.100
Pink,

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:13.667
C.

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:14.200
Drum,

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.300
or D.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:15.867
Harp?

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:16.967
Five seconds!

00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:23.933
TIME'S UP!

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:25.967
The answer is...

00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:26.433
B,

00:00:26.433 --> 00:00:26.900
pink!

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:27.333
Drum,

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:27.800
harp,

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.100
and trumpet are all instruments.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.900
Pink is a color,

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.200
so it does not belong.

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:36.367
Here's one,

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:37.833
a picture puzzle!

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:40.300
Which shape completes the pattern?

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:40.800
A.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.267
A filled star,

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:42.767
B.

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:44.233
A filled triangle,

00:00:44.233 --> 00:00:44.733
C.

00:00:44.733 --> 00:00:46.233
A filled heart,

00:00:46.233 --> 00:00:47.200
or D.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:49.167
A filled lightning bolt?

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:50.167
Five seconds!

00:00:55.967 --> 00:00:57.167
TIME'S UP!

00:00:57.833 --> 00:00:58.967
The answer is...

00:00:58.967 --> 00:00:59.333
D,

00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:00.800
a filled lightning bolt!

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.033
The rule is the shape gets

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:05.267
filled in but stays the same

00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:05.667
shape,

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:07.500
so the empty lightning becomes

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.633
a filled lightning.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.167
Here's one,

00:01:11.167 --> 00:01:13.200
a number series!

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:13.867
Two,

00:01:13.867 --> 00:01:14.567
nine,

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:15.233
eleven,

00:01:15.233 --> 00:01:15.933
twenty,

00:01:15.933 --> 00:01:16.600
thirty-one,

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:17.967
and then...

00:01:17.967 --> 00:01:20.000
what comes next?

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:20.667
A.

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:21.367
Fifty-one,

00:01:21.367 --> 00:01:22.033
B.

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:22.733
Fifty-four,

00:01:22.733 --> 00:01:23.400
C.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.067
Forty-six,

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:25.433
or D.

00:01:25.433 --> 00:01:26.133
Forty-nine?

00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:27.467
Five seconds!

00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:34.467
TIME'S UP!

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:36.667
The answer is...

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:37.167
A,

00:01:37.167 --> 00:01:37.700
fifty-one!

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:40.733
Add the two numbers before it:

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:43.300
thirty-one plus twenty is fifty-one.

00:01:44.433 --> 00:01:44.833
So,

00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:46.867
are you smart or fart?

00:01:46.867 --> 00:01:49.300
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.500
find your rank!

00:01:51.667 --> 00:01:52.000
So,

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.400
how did you do?

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.767
Comment your score below,

00:01:54.767 --> 00:01:56.133
and follow for more!
